# Apple Push Notification service (APNs)
# Format: Surge external RULE-SET (no policy in this file)
# Version: 2026-07-28.1
# Sources:
# - Apple APNs network ranges: support.apple.com/102266
# - Surge SYSTEM ruleset APNs domains: manual.nssurge.com/rule/ruleset.html
#
# Usage example:
# RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Graham-lo/surge/master/rules/APNs.list,♻️ 手动切换,no-resolve
#
# Place the RULE-SET line before RULE-SET,SYSTEM,DIRECT,
# Apple DIRECT rules, GEOIP,CN,DIRECT and FINAL.

# APNs domains
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,push.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,push-apple.com.akadns.net
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,apple.com.edgekey.net

# Apple-published APNs IPv4 ranges
IP-CIDR,17.249.0.0/16
IP-CIDR,17.252.0.0/16
IP-CIDR,17.57.144.0/22
IP-CIDR,17.188.128.0/18
IP-CIDR,17.188.20.0/23

# Apple-published APNs IPv6 ranges
IP-CIDR6,2620:149:a44::/48
IP-CIDR6,2403:300:a42::/48
IP-CIDR6,2403:300:a51::/48
IP-CIDR6,2a01:b740:a42::/48
